# Checkouts get LF line endings on every PC. Some tests read files such as Wuber.toc and README.md and
# look for text that ends in a newline, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true (CRLF) failed 5 tests.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.tga binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.blp binary
*.zip binary
